\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Conradus Dryburg:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura secundi libri Decretalium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit lectura secundi libri decretalium \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 Erfordie lecta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In nomine patris ... Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prologus:]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Pro aggressu lecture [interlinear eingef\u252 \'fcgt: huius libri] secundi, qui est de iudiciis adhoc etc}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . ... recipio pro introitu ipsius hec uerba: \lquote Summum bonum est in rebus iustitiam colere\rquote  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expeditis preparatoriis iudiciorum ad iudicia veniamus. Et dixi \lquote iudicia\rquote  in plurali}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... uirtutum documenta humilitatis custodiam aggregare. Quod ipse dei filius sue matris deuotis participare dignetur. Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rest der Seite leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

