\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit lectura quinti decretalium. In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Prologus:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lxxiii. d. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine \u183 \'b7 C \u183 \'b7 de officio praefecti Africae, et \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gestrichen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 subiungam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ersetzt durch:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sequitur statim. Amen. ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] [Marginalglosse vom Schreiber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber quintus Decretalium, qui est de criminibus et ipsorum penis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... unde, ut dicit Ost\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [iensis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hic in summa in principio huius quinti: \lquote Utinam saperent homines et intelligerent ...\rquote  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 - ... quod nobis omnibus concedat dominus noster vivens in secula benedictus.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

