\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Papst {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonifatius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  IX., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bulle}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \lquote Regia circumspectio\rquote }}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  an K\u246 \'f6nig {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Karl VI}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 . von Frankreich, 2. April 1392\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Copia uera bulle misse regi Francie per dominum nostrum papam que falsificata fuit. Bonifatius episcopus etc. Carissimo in Christo filio Carolo regi Francorum illustri salutem etc. Regia circumspectio, videt et prout fide dignorum quamplurimum relatus nostras crebro perducit ad aures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... quod omnipotens deus uniuersale malum hoc summopere deflendum scisma sue sancte ecclesie peccatis exigentibus permisit ... - ... Ad premissa ergo non grauaberis respondere. Datum Rome apud sanctum Petrum iiii Nonas Aprilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [pontificatus nostri]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno tercio.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: Luc \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 d\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \rquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ach\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ry\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Veterum aliquot scriptorum, qui in Galliae bibliothecis ... latuerant, spicilegium, Bd. 6, Paris 1664, S. 54-56. Zu Beziehung zwischen Bonifatius IX und K\u246 \'f6nig Karl VI. vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Jansen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Papst Bonifatius IX. (s. o. 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 28, 31 u. \u246 \'f6.; Arnold \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Esch\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonifaz IX. und der Kirchenstaat, T\u252 \'fcbingen 1969 (Bibliothek des Deutschen Historischen Instituts in Rom 29), S. 69-73 u. \u246 \'f6.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

