\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Papst {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonifatius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  IX., Bulle {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \lquote Ad nostram iam pridem notitiam\rquote }}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 , 17. Juni 1393\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Copia bulle misse ceteris principibus ad Almaniam super falsitate bulle precedentis. Bonifatius episcopus etc. Ad nostram iam pridem noticiam et per modum quod ita esset ..., quod Carolus rex Francorum illusoris hiis aut similibus uerbis frequencius utebatur se super ecclesie diuisione instante dampnato scismate ... - ... requirimus et precamur. Datum Perusii xv. kalendas Julii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [pontificatus nostri]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno quarto.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Keine Edition ermittelt. Erw\u228 \'e4hnt werden als Gesandte des Papstes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 dilectus filus Petrus de Mantenia prior \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [A?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 sten. Carthusiensis ordinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Bartholomaeus de Bauenna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [f\u252 \'fcr: Ravenna]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  prior Gorgonie eiusdem ordinis ..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . (Kartause St. Maria und Gorgonio auf der Insel Gorgona bei Livorno).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Palatino Linotype;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

