\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Papst {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonifatius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  IX., Bulle {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8218 \'82Praefari non est diu\lquote }}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 K\u246 \'f6nig Karl VI}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 . von Frankreich, 20. Juni 1393\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Copia bulle secunde misse regi Francie per dominum nostrum papam per ... ipsius regis ambaciatores. Bonifatius episcopus etc. Carissimo in Christo filio Carolo regi Francorum illustri salutem etc. Perfecto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sonst: Praefari]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non est diu, que ad materiam congruam videbantur, tue sublimitati scripsimus ... - ... Expectabimus a te de tua disposicione certius informari. Datum Perusii xii. kalendas Julii, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [pontificatus nostri]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno quarto.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 d\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \rquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ach\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ry\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Veterum aliquot scriptorum ... spicilegium, Bd. 6 (s. o. 226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 57-59.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

