\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Hand 1:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  in actu recommendationis doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine patris et filii ... lxxiii di \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in nomine domini ad uerba et recommendacionem domini doctoris etc. ... \lquote Ego sum\rquote : hec uerba ponitur exodi iii\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Ex 3,6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et xxii, Iohannis vi ... Reuerendi patres uenerabilesque domini ac amici carissimi. Quoniam scriptum ad Ebreos 5\u176 \'b0 capitulo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Hbr 5,4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ..., quod nemo debet assumere honorem nisi qui vocatus fuerit tamquam Aaron ... - ... Quod oculus non uidit, auris non \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [audivit ..., Textverlust] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad Cho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rinthos?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Cor 2,9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Quod nobis concedat Ihesus Christ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [us ...].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Am unteren und rechten Rand beschnitten.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

