\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Rubrica de poenitentiis et remissionibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lectura \u252 \'fcber X 5.38.12/13).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Rubrica de pe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nitentiis]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et re\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [missionibus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prologus:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 U<Iso de penis, que infliguntur in foro contentioso}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et iudiciali et pro manifestis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs24 >O<mnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= X 5.38.12: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnis utriusque sexus fidelis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, Sp. 887f.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quilibet doli capax tenetur saltem semel in anno confiteri suo proprio sacerdoti ... - ... spiritum sanctum misit insignum benedictionis eterne. Ad quam nos perducat omnipotens deus. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ein Text mit diesem Incipit auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel, HAB, Cod. 81.9.Aug}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .fol. (Braunschweig?, 1475/76), 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Heinemann,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Wolfenb\u252 \'fcttel, Aug. IV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  S. 25.
