\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Quaestio 10: Ausf\u252 \'fchrungen zur translatio imperii vom R\u246 \'f6mischen zum Heiligen R\u246 \'f6mischen Reich: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur 10}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs32\chcbpat17 mo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , qualiter translatum est imperium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quot modis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et qualiter uenit, quod Teutonici hodie possident imperium ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Otto primus imperauit xii annis et imperauit in Italia et in Almania ... tandem in Maydenburg ecclesiam sancti Mauricii mire pulchritudinis fabricauit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Quaestio 11: Ausf\u252 \'fchrungen zur Wahl des deutschen Kaisers durch die Kurf\u252 \'fcrsten:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur undecimo, qui habent eligere imperatores}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quis confirmare et ex quibus causis. ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Carolus rex, IV., Bulla aurea, Prooemium:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iam accedo ad Bullam auream que sic incipit: In nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis ... Karolus quartus diuina fauente clementia Romanorum imperator ... Omne regnum in se \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ipsum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diuisum desolabitur, nam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 principes ejus facti sunt socii furum ... - ... Sub anno domini millesimo ccclvi\u176 \'b0, indictione nona, 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  idus Januarii, regnorum nostrorum anno decimo, imperii vero primo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [10. Jan. 1356]; es folgen (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ausf\u252 \'fchrungen zu cap. I-XVII der Bulla aurea: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur primus titulus cuius rubrica sic incipit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qualis debet esse conductus principum electorum et a quibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nur Prooemium vollst. zitiert, vgl. Wolfgang D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fritz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Goldene Bulle Kaiser Karls IV. vom Jahre 1356, Text, Weimar 1972 (MGH, Leges, Fontes iuris Germanici antiqui in usum scholarum seperatim editi 11), S. 44-73.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nam venio ad ultimam partem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Per cuius expedicionem ego quero, quod est tributum, uectigal, theolonium ... - ... Expedito rubro uenio ad nigrum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;}

