\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Infrascripti sunt casus qui de iure civili puniuntur ad mortem<.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui christianum hodio nominis christiani dilapidat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut C. de Iudeis, l. ii. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (C. 1, 9)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Qui maius sacrilegium facit, ut C. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad leg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 em\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iul\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ulatus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , l. sacrilegii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 48, 13, 7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... - ... Et im \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 predictis malefitiis proceditur de similibus ad similia, ut ff. de re milit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , l. milites \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (D. 49, 16, 13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... et similia capite puniuntur. Ita dicit Baldus in dicta sua repetitione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 55 Casus, jeweils mit Stellenverweisen auf den Codex Iustinianus und die Digesten.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

