\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Liber I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 118 Kapitel, lt. Register 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. o.) mit einf\u252 \'fchrenden Kapiteln zu 55 acta zusammengefasst:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Liber primus de uoluminibus statutorum communis Mantue de regimine et electione domini potestatis.< >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S<Tatuimus, quod in ciuitate Mantue debeat esse dominus potestas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qui sit progenie nobilis ... - ... >N<e hedificiorum ruinis Mantuana ciuitas deformat presens statutum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rest von 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und 62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer); }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Liber II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 70 Kapitel, lt. Register 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. o.) zu 35 acta zusammengefasst:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Liber secundus de uolumine statutorum communis Mantue. De offitio domini potestatis et vicarij et iudicum in causis ciuilibus.< >S<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tatuimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et ordinamus, quod dominus potestas, qui nunc est ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [am Ende Datierungen einzelner Statuten:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De casibus in quibus appellari non posset nec admitti debeat.< ... per iudicem gabellarum communis Mantue die 14. Jullij 1404 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [14.07.1404]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Addicientes declarareque volentes in causis datiorum vel gabellarum ... - ... publicatum fuit die viij. Jullij M\u176 \'b0ccccviij \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [08.07.1408]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Rest von 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer);}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Liber III\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 157 Kapitel, lt. Register 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. o.) zu 48 acta zusammengefasst:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Liber tercius de uolumine statutorum communis Mantue. De offitio et potestate iudicis condemnationum et gabellarum.< >E<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 T indemnitati}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  communis Mantue circa condemnationes et gabellas in commune Mantue ... - ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [am Ende Datierungen einzelner Statuten bzw. Nennung einzelner Notare:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De datio tracte bladorum soluendo< ... Factum fuit dictum statutum die quinto Marcij 1407 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [05.03.1407]; (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Quod nullus officialis audeat aliquid accipere ultra eius salarium< ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Hoc statutum fuit dictatum et notatum per dominum abbatem sancti Andree de Mantua ... die prima mensis Aprillis millesimo quadringentesimo tercio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [01.04.1403] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et scriptum per me {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Barth}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [olom]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 eum de Aldrouandis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Reperitur in primo libro voluminis statutorum communis Mantue ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Quod naute cum eorum nauibus oneratis ...< ... Hoc statutum registratum fuit per me {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedictum de Nicolis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  notarium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De ordine solutionis fiende per Malagrios existentes ad herbaticum super territorio Mantuano< ... Dictum statutum factum et dictatum fuit ... die x. mensis Februarij 1407 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [10.02.1407]; (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De modo et forma procedendi contra debitores magnifici domini Mantue et communis Mantue ...< ... sine strepitu et figura iudicii. Publicatum fuit die Sabato quintodecimo mensis Decembris Millesimo quadringentesimo octauo, indictione prima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [15.12.1408]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Finis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Keine Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung (vgl. aber Zusammenfassung mehrerer Kapitel zu \u8218 \'82acta\rquote  lt. Register). Zum Teil umfangreiche marginale Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden des 15. und 16. Jh.s.: teilweise datierte Ausf\u252 \'fchrungen zur G\u252 \'fcltigkeit einzelner Statuten (z. B. 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : 1531), Verweise auf andere Statuten (z. B. 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Statut vom 07.02.1430; 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Statut des Markgrafs Ludovico II. von Mantua vom 19.04.1469, Notar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Johannes Arrivabenis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Quellenverweise (z. B. 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen (z. B. 126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Marginalglossen z. T. beschnitten (z. B. 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

