\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Nachtrag, 1539:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Statuta magnificorum dominorum medicorum almae civitatis Mantuae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Promulgation:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IN CHRISTI NOMINE AMEN. Anno a Natiuitate Millesimo Quingentesimo Trigesimo nono, indictione duodecima, tempore serenissimi principis et domini domini Caroli diuina ei fauente clementia Romanorum Imperatoris semper augusti, die Martis penultimo mensis Aprilis 1539 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [29.04.1539]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , de sera hora vigesima uel circa, magnifici et clarissimi Jureconsulti, dominus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[18].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nazarius Scopulus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ducalis auditor, et dominus Antonius Delphinus sindicus et commisarius generalis ambo, ducales consiliarii et senatores dignissimi ... -\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24  ... Nomina omnium et singularom dominorum Medicorum, qui fuerunt presentes publicationi pr\u281 \'eadict\u281 \'ea, et iurauerunt ut supra, sequuntur, videlicet: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [(171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liste der 19 anwesenden Mitglieder:]\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24  Pr\u281 \'eafatus Magnificus D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[16].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[16].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gabloneta Viceprior}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Mag. D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[15].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ludovicus Panicia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Mag. D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[14].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Baptista Cremaschus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Sp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ectabilis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[13].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Philippus Arriuabenus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... Mag. D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[11].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Julius Delphinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et et Sp. D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[12].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Laurentius Staghellinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [(171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liste der 10 abwesenden Mitglieder:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nomina uero aliorum absentium, qui non iurau\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 erunt: Sp. D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[9].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Baptista Fi\u281 \'eara}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Mag\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 cus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eques D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[10].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Jacobus Arriuabenus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Sp. D. Jo: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[17].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maria Facinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... Sp. D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[8].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Camillus Suardus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et Sp. D. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Caternus Arnulphus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Prologus:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IN DEI NOMINE ... FEDERICVS DVX MANTUAE MARCHIO MONTISFERRATI etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Federico II. Gonzaga (1519-1540)]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum deceat unumquemque optimum principem in rebus suis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Text:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 STATVTA MAGNIFICORVM DOMINORVM MEDICORUM ALM\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u280 \'ca\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CIVITATIS MANTU\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u280 \'ca sequuntur, uidelicet: DE CONVOCATIONE dominorum Medicorum, et Collegio facien\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 do, et electione primi prioris. CAPitulo primo ... - ... \plain \f3\i\fs24 ex dispositione Juris ali\u230 \'bf egregi\u230 \'bf person\u281 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 am Ende (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Eintrag des Notars: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Franciscus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  filius probi viri domini {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannis Iacobi de Veronensibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  publicus apostolica et imperiali auctoritatibus notarius ac prefatorum magnificorum et clarissimorum ducalium Senatorum notarius, et scriba, suprascriptorum statutorum in hoc uolumine manu mea ... scripsi meque in eorum fidem cum meis signo, nomine et cognomine consuetis subscripsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , daneben Notariatszeichen mit Monogramm \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I F V.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Eingeteilt in 32 Kapitel. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Nazario Scopulo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (\u8222 \'84qui Mantu\u230 \'e6 sub Frederico, Francisco, Guilelmo Principibus, Senatui & auditorio 40. annos de iure respondit\rdblquote , \u8224 \'86 1568), vgl.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Janus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gruterus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Chronicon Chronicorvm Ecclesiastico-Politicvm [...], Frankfurt 1614, Bd. II, S. 1269 (vgl. Digitalisat: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 http://reader.digitale-sammlungen.de/resolve/display/bsb10024990.html\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Zu den genannten, in Mantua t\u228 \'e4tigen \u196 \'c4rzten {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Giacomo Arrivabene}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (\u8222 \'84excelentissimae artium et medicinae doctor\ldblquote , \u8224 \'86 1542) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Girolamo Gabbioneta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (\u8224 \'86 1553) vgl. Guido \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rebecchini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Portraits by Objects. Three \u8218 \'82Studioli\lquote  in sixteenth century Mantua, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . / P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Jackson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hg.), Mantova e il Rinascimento italiano. Studi in onore di David S. Chambers, Mantua 2011, S. 77-94. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Giulio Delfino}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Arzt in Mantua und Professor in Pavia (\u8224 \'861564), Verfasser von medizinischen Werken (In III Galeni artis medicinalis lib. explanatio und Quaestiones medicinales, Venedig 1557 und 1559), vgl. EDIT16, Nr. CNCE 16438/16439.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17  Camillo Suardi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Verfasser eines medizinischen Drucks: Dogma de putredine, o. O. und J (um 1539), vgl. EDIT16, Nr. CNCE 29517.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

