\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Nachtrag von etwas j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand: \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Liber VI, cap. 1 und 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig), ohne Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De parentibus, agnatis et cognatis compellendis ad compromissam faciendum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Item statutum et ordinatum est, quod si aliqua lis questio seu controuersia est uel erit inter aliquos ascendentes ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eodem. Item statutum et ordinatum est, quod sententie et precepta arbitrorum ... - ... vel eam reformare, qua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [parte infra menses novem ..., bricht ab; Rest von 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer;}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Liber II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 384 Kapitel:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >INcipit liber secundus statutorum communis Nouarie. De solemnitate adhibenda in electione officialium.< >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I<N primis teneatur postestas seu rector}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , antequam eligi faciat aliquam personam in officio communis Nouarie ... - ... debeat cancellari, soluendo prout supra.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Am Ende von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand (19. Jh.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Quod fiat festum sancti Rochi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (nach Edition [s. u.], S. 306f.: nachtr\u228 \'e4gliche Bestimmung vom 10.09.1485, hier bis auf \u220 \'dcberschrift nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt), Rest von 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  leer;}

