\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Ps 68,2f.: ..., {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 quoniam intraverunt aquae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 usque ad animam meam. Infix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [us sum in limo pro]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fundi et non est substancia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >De S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [...]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  martyre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Tractus [Ps 101,1f.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Domi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ne, exaudi orationem meam, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [et clamor] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 meus ad te ve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [niat. Non avertas ..., s. u. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ];
