\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Angaben zu W\u228 \'e4hrungen und Bu\u223 \'dfzahlungen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item en schylling engels iii stoters. En schyllinge sterlinges viiij stoters. En punth grothe sterlinges vi golt gr. Andreas. ... - ... Item wanth daz recht geslothen is ... - ... alle bothe ende brocke mach nijcht hoger rysen dan veruolth.
