\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Bl. 147 (Nr. 7,I)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u228 \'e4u\u223 \'dferes Bl. einer 9er-Lage (Pergament), am oberen Seitenrand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 147.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [evtl. Predigt zum Fest Circumcisio domini (01.01.), Beginn verloren:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 deus erat verbum et verbum caro factum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. Io 1,1-14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... factum caro sic patitur ... in circumcisione ... Sex sunt etates secundum Ysidorum in libro ethimologiarum. Prima est infantia, quia tunc fari non potest, id est loqui ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 bis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sexta etas est senectus, que nullo annorum tempore finitur ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (= {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Etymologiarum libri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  XX, lib. 11, cap. 2/7)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Quatuor conditiones habet puer. Prima est mentis munditia ... Secunda conditio pueri est humilitas ... Sua humilitas maxime in circumcisione monstratur ... - ... Uas electionis est mihi iste, ut portet nomen meum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Act 9,15).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

