\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (9,I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Sermo \u252 \'fcber die Taufe (De effecto baptismi?), evtl. zugeh\u246 \'f6rig zu 8,I und 12,II?, beginnt:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ego baptizo te in nomine patris propter defectum lingue}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... baptizans simul abluat et uerbum proferat ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (9,I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) schematische Gliederung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... Primo utrum effectus baptismi sit deletio omnis culpe, secundo utrum sit remissio pene ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (9,II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Predigtbeginn verloren, am Beginn Zitat:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 uisitauit cor meum et immutauit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , ut amara fierent que mirabiliter dulcia prius erant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bernardus Clara\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 vallensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo de misericordiis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , pars 4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Aufz\u228 \'e4hlung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... 12\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  panis est retractionale ... 13\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  panis est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [...]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  videlicet \lquote in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 odio preteritorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alorum, et contemptu bonorum presentium, et desiderio futurorum\rquote  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (= {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermo in Dominica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  VI. post Pentecosten II, pars 6)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . 14\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  panis est fiduciale ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (9,II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  fast vollst\u228 \'e4ndig verloren); (9,II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Aufz\u228 \'e4hlung:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per legem diuinam .... per legem euangelicam ... Domine, quis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [habitat]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in tabernaculo tuo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 14,1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 am unteren Seitenrand Erg\u228 \'e4nzung des Schreibers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ... tibi ancilla introducas ... ecce iam ueni ... taliter uigila ... et libenter sine questione et murmuratione ... obediens usque ad mortem crucis ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

