\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Nr. 1 und 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Digestum vetus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : D.7.1.13.7-D.7.1.36.2.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ad alium modum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conuertere: excolere enim quod inuenit potest qualitate edium non inmutata. ... Et Iulianus quidem libro xxxv. D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [igestorum] (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : D.7.1.25.3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scripsit, quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [interlinear eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fructuario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adquiri non potest proprietario queri. ... - ... in quo seruus sit mortuus, usus f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ructus aestimetur].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://8350[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Krueger}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Corpus Iuris Civilis, Bd. I, S. 129-131.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 \par}

